<http://dbpedia.org/resource/1974_Yale_Bulldogs_football_team> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 1974 Yale Bulldogs football team represented Yale University in the 1974 NCAA Division I football season. The Bulldogs were led by tenth-year head coach Carmen Cozza, played their home games at the Yale Bowl and tied for first place in the Ivy League with a 6–1 record, 8–1 overall."@en .
