<http://dbpedia.org/resource/1920_Oklahoma_A&M_Aggies_football_team> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 1920 Oklahoma A&M Aggies football team represented Oklahoma A&M College in the 1920 college football season. This was the 20th year of football at A&M and the second under Jim Pixlee. The Aggies played their home games at Lewis Field in Stillwater, Oklahoma. They finished the season 0–7–1, 0–3 in the Southwest Conference."@en .
