<http://dbpedia.org/resource/2022_LBL_Play-offs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 2022 LBL Play-offs was the tournament to determine the Latvian Basketball League champions for the 2021–22 season. All participating teams spent the regular season in Latvian-Estonian Basketball League, with the top six Latvian teams advancing to the LBL play-offs. The play-offs began on 13 April."@en .
