<http://dbpedia.org/resource/1974_Colgate_Red_Raiders_football_team> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 1974 Colgate Red Raiders football team was an American football team that represented Colgate University as an independent during the 1974 NCAA Division I football season. In its seventh season under head coach Neil Wheelwright, the team compiled a 4–5 record. Robert Como and James Detmer were the team captains. The team played its home games at Andy Kerr Stadium in Hamilton, New York."@en .
