<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ajith_Kollam> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ajith Kollam (7 April 1962 – 5 April 2018) was an Indian actor, who predominantly appeared in Malayalam cinema. He had acted in more than 500 films in all South Indian languages. He mainly acted in villain roles. He acted in the Tamil movie Airport (1993)."@en .
