<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Breel-Donald Embolo, né le 14 février 1997 à Yaoundé au Cameroun est un footballeur international suisse qui évolue au poste d'attaquant à l'AS Monaco. Il possède aussi la nationalité camerounaise"@fr .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Breel Donald Embolo (born 14 February 1997) is a Cameroonian-born Swiss professional footballer who plays as a forward for Ligue 1 club Monaco and the Switzerland national team. Born in Cameroon, Embolo moved with his family to France before finally settling in Switzerland. After working his way through their junior teams, Embolo made his professional debut for Basel in March 2014, and won the Swiss Super League in all three of his first seasons before moving to Schalke 04 for a reported fee of €20 million. Shortly after moving to the Bundesliga, he suffered an ankle injury that ruled him out for nearly a year. He later played in Germany for Borussia Mönchengladbach and in the French Ligue 1 for Monaco. Embolo made his senior international debut in 2015, earning over 60 caps. He represented Switzerland at the UEFA European Championship in 2016 and 2020, and at the FIFA World Cup in the 2018 and 2022."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "بريل دونالد إمبولو (بالفرنسية: Breel Embolo)‏ (مواليد 14 فبراير 1997) هو لاعب كرة قدم سويسري محترف. لعب مع منتخب سويسرا تحت 21 سنة كما شارك في عدة مباريات بقميص المنتخب الأول منذ مارس 2015 وقد تم اختياره لتمثيله في بطولة أمم أوروبا لكرة القدم 2016."@ar .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "布雷爾·唐納德·恩博洛（英語：Breel Donald Embolo，1997年2月14日－）是瑞士的職業足球運動員，司職中場或前鋒，現效力於法甲球队摩納哥。"@zh .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Breel Embolo (lahir 14 Februari 1997) adalah seorang pemain sepak bola keturunan Kamerun, berkewarganegaraan Swiss yang bermain untuk klub AS MONACO pada posisi Penyerang. Breel Embolo bermain untuk klub AS MONACO sejak tahun 2022, dan membela tim nasional Swiss sejak tahun 2015."@in .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Breel-Donald Embolo (Yaoundé, 14 februari 1997) is een Zwitsers voetballer van Kameroense afkomst die doorgaans als aanvaller speelt. Hij verruilde FC Schalke 04 in juli 2019 voor Borussia Mönchengladbach. Embolo debuteerde in 2015 in het Zwitsers voetbalelftal."@nl .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Breel Donald Embolo (* 14. Februar 1997 in Yaoundé, Kamerun) ist ein schweizerisch-kamerunischer Fussballspieler. Der Stürmer steht bei der AS Monaco unter Vertrag und spielt für die Schweizer Nationalmannschaft."@de .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Breel_Embolo> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Breel Donald Embolo, född 14 februari 1997 i Yaoundé, Kamerun, är en schweizisk fotbollsspelare som spelar för AS Monaco. Han representerar även Schweiz landslag."@sv .
