<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Babu_Antony> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Babu Antony (born 22 February 1966) is an Indian-American actor and martial artist, who works primarily in Malayalam cinema. He has also acted in several Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Sinhalese, Hindi and English films. He started his career doing antagonistic roles and progressed to supporting and leading roles as well. Babu owns a mixed martial art academy in Houston. He made his debut in Bharathan's Chilampu (1986). His career highlights include Vaishali (1988), Aparahnam (1991) and Uppukandam Brothers (1993)."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Babu_Antony> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "بابو أنتوني هو مخرج وممثل هندي، ولد في 22 فبراير 1966 في الهند."@ar .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Babu_Antony> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Babu Antony (born 22 February 1966) is an Indian-American actor and martial artist, who works primarily in Malayalam cinema. He has also acted in several Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Sinhalese, Hindi and English films. He started his career doing antagonistic roles and progressed to supporting and leading roles as well. Babu owns a mixed martial art academy in Houston. He made his debut in Bharathan's Chilampu (1986). His career highlights include Vaishali (1988), Aparahnam (1991) and Uppukandam Brothers (1993)."@en .
