<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Charlotte_Payne-Townshend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Charlotte Frances Payne-Townshend (20 January 1857 – 12 September 1943) was an Irish political activist in Britain. She was a member of the Fabian Society and was dedicated to the struggle for women's rights. She married the playwright George Bernard Shaw."@en .
