<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Charle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Velmurugan Thangasamy Manohar (born 6 March 1960), professionally credited as Charle, is an Indian actor who works in Tamil cinema. He has acted in more than 800 Tamil films as a comedian and supporting actor. He was named after the English comedian Charlie Chaplin."@en .
