<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cold_Blood_(band)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cold Blood is a long-standing R&B horn funk band founded by Larry Field in 1968, and was originally based in the East Bay region of the San Francisco Bay Area. The band has also performed and recorded under the name Lydia Pense and Cold Blood, due to the popularity of their lead singer, Lydia Pense."@en .
