<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daleu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Daleu est une ville de la Région des Dix-Huit Montagnes située au nord de la Côte d'Ivoire, dans le département de Danané dont elle est l'une des sous-préfectures. \n* Portail de la Côte d’Ivoire"@fr .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daleu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Daleu is a town in the far west of Ivory Coast. It is a sub-prefecture of Danané Department in Tonkpi Region, Montagnes District. Daleu was a commune until March 2012, when it became one of 1126 communes nationwide that were abolished. In 2014, the population of the sub-prefecture of Daleu was 34,308."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daleu> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Daleu è una città e sottoprefettura della Costa d'Avorio appartenente al dipartimento di Danané. Conta una popolazione di 34 308 abitanti (censimento 2014)."@it .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daleu> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Daleu est une ville de la Région des Dix-Huit Montagnes située au nord de la Côte d'Ivoire, dans le département de Danané dont elle est l'une des sous-préfectures. \n* Portail de la Côte d’Ivoire"@fr .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daleu> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Daleu is a town in the far west of Ivory Coast. It is a sub-prefecture of Danané Department in Tonkpi Region, Montagnes District. Daleu was a commune until March 2012, when it became one of 1126 communes nationwide that were abolished. In 2014, the population of the sub-prefecture of Daleu was 34,308."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Daleu> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Daleu è una città e sottoprefettura della Costa d'Avorio appartenente al dipartimento di Danané. Conta una popolazione di 34 308 abitanti (censimento 2014)."@it .
