<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Design-to-cost> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q20819819> .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Design-to-cost> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Category:Cost_engineering> .
