<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gautami_filmography> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Gautami Tadimalla is an Indian actor, costume designer, and producer who works mainly in Tamil, Telugu. She has acted in Tamil, Telugu, Malayalam, Kannada, and Hindi movies. She is an acclaimed costume designer and won the 2008 Vijay Award for Best Costume Designer for her work on the Tamil movie Dasavatharam."@en .
