<http://dbpedia.org/resource/First_International_Tramways_and_Light_Railways_Exhibition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The First International Tramways and Light Railways Exhibition was held in the Royal Agricultural Hall, Islington, London from 30 June 1900 – 11 July 1900. The International Tramways and Light Railways Exhibition was promoted by \"The Tramway and Railway World\". The exhibitors included: Mr. O'Brien won the competition for reversible tramway seats."@en .
