<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ganjegan-e_Olya> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ganjegan-e Olya (Persian: گنجگان عليا, also Romanized as Ganejgān-e ‘Olyā) is a village in Sarrud-e Jonubi Rural District, in the Central District of Boyer-Ahmad County, Kohgiluyeh and Boyer-Ahmad Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 84, in 18 families."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ganjegan-e_Olya> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "غنجغان العلیا (بالفارسية: گنجگان علیا) هي قرية تقع في إيران في قسم سررود الجنوبي الريفي. يقدر عدد سكانها بـ 44 نسمة بحسب إحصاء 2016."@ar .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ganjegan-e_Olya> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Ganjegan-e Olya (Persian: گنجگان عليا, also Romanized as Ganejgān-e ‘Olyā) is a village in Sarrud-e Jonubi Rural District, in the Central District of Boyer-Ahmad County, Kohgiluyeh and Boyer-Ahmad Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 84, in 18 families."@en .
