<http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_William_Kijazi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "John William Kijazi (18 November 1956 – 17 February 2021) was a Tanzanian diplomat and Chancellor of the University of Dodoma. He was appointed the Chief Secretary to the President of Tanzania on 9 March 2016 by the President John Magufuli."@en .
