<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jacob_van_Wassenaer_Obdam> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Jacob Baron van Wassenaer Obdam (* 1610 in Den Haag, Niederlande; † 13. Juni 1665 in Lowestoft, Königreich England) war Admiral von Holland und Westfriesland sowie Kavallerie-Oberst und Gouverneur von Heusden."@de .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jacob_van_Wassenaer_Obdam> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Jacob, Banner Lord of Wassenaer, Lord Obdam, Hensbroek, Spanbroek, Opmeer, Zuidwijk and Kernhem (1610 – 13 June 1665) was a Dutch nobleman who became lieutenant admiral, and supreme commander of the navy of the Dutch Republic. The name Obdam was then also spelled as Opdam. British contemporaneous sources typically refer to him as Admiral Opdam or Lord Obdam because it was not until 1657 that he bought the Wassenaar Estate from relatives and thus acquired its title. Modern Dutch sources sometimes less correctly insert a second \"van\" between \"Wassenaer\" and \"Obdam\" or use the modern spelling \"Wassenaar\"."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jacob_van_Wassenaer_Obdam> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Якоб ван Вассенар, барон Обдам (нидерл. Jacob van Wassenaer Obdam; 1610, Гаага — 13 июня 1665, Лоустофт) — голландский лейтенант-адмирал, верховный главнокомандующий объединённого флота Нидерландов, живший в XVII столетии."@ru .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jacob_van_Wassenaer_Obdam> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Jacob van Wassenaer Obdam (niderl. Jacob, Baanderheer van Wassenaer, Heer van Obdam, Hensbroek, Spanbroek, Spierdijk, Schoonouwen, Opmeer, Zuidwijk en Kernhem) (ur. 1610, 23 czerwca 1665) – holenderski admirał i naczelny wódz floty holenderskiej."@pl .
