<http://dbpedia.org/resource/List_of_Ardisia_species> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ardisia is a large, broadly distributed genus of flowering shrubs, trees and woody herbs in the primrose family, Primulaceae. As of January 2019, there are over 700 accepted species in Kew's Plants of the World Online."@en .
