<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Latvijas_Universitāte_men's_basketball> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Latvijas Universitāte men's basketball team represents University of Latvia in Riga, Latvia, also known as LU. and it plays in the Latvian Basketball League and Latvian-Estonian Basketball League. The LU once won seven Latvian championships in the 1930s and returned to the Latvian League Division 1 before the 2010-11 season. The biggest accomplishment so far has been 4th place in the 2011-2012 season. Team is organized by University of Latvia."@en .
