<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lalu_Alex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lalu Alex is an Indian actor who works in Malayalam cinema. In a career spanning four decades, Lalu Alex has acted over 250 movies and is known for his character roles, comic roles and antagonistic roles in Malayalam movie industry. Lalu Alex started his acting career as a supporting actor in the movie Ee Ganam Marakkumo in 1978 and associated with notable movies in his earlier career including Idi Muzhakkam, Nayattu (directed by Sreekumaran Thampi), Meen, Thushaaram and Thrishna. He has also acted in three Tamil movies."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lalu_Alex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "لولا أليكس هو ممثل هندي، ولد في 30 نوفمبر 1954 في الهند."@ar .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lalu_Alex> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Lalu Alex is an Indian actor who works in Malayalam cinema. In a career spanning four decades, Lalu Alex has acted over 250 movies and is known for his character roles, comic roles and antagonistic roles in Malayalam movie industry. Lalu Alex started his acting career as a supporting actor in the movie Ee Ganam Marakkumo in 1978 and associated with notable movies in his earlier career including Idi Muzhakkam, Nayattu (directed by Sreekumaran Thampi), Meen, Thushaaram and Thrishna. He has also acted in three Tamil movies."@en .
