<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Miguel_Gomez_(actor)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Miguel Gomez (also known as Aztek Escobar; born August 20, 1985) is a Colombian-American actor and rapper. Escobar was the first artist officially signed to Jay-Z's Roc La Familia Label. From 2021 to 2022, he is starring as Ivan Ortiz on CBS crime drama series FBI: Most Wanted."@en .
