<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nanya_River> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Nanya River is the primary right tributary of the middle Dadu River (Dadu He) — in Sichuan Province, southern China. The Dadu is a tributary of the upper Yangtze River (Chang Jiang). The Nanya River borders Mianning County and Shimian County and is interrupted by the Yele Dam."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nanya_River> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "The Nanya River is the primary right tributary of the middle Dadu River (Dadu He) — in Sichuan Province, southern China. The Dadu is a tributary of the upper Yangtze River (Chang Jiang). The Nanya River borders Mianning County and Shimian County and is interrupted by the Yele Dam."@en .
