<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Prime_minister> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/thumbnail> <http://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/The_Prime_Ministers_of_the_Nordic_Council_in_October_2014_-_09.jpg?width=300> .
