<http://dbpedia.org/resource/S._P._Venkatesh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "S. P. Venkatesh (also credited as Sangeetharajan; born 5 March 1955) is an Indian music director and composer who primarily works in Malayalam films. He was at his prime in the late 80s and 90s, being reputed for his background scores and songs in Malayalam cinema."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/S._P._Venkatesh> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "S. P. Venkatesh (also credited as Sangeetharajan; born 5 March 1955) is an Indian music director and composer who primarily works in Malayalam films. He was at his prime in the late 80s and 90s, being reputed for his background scores and songs in Malayalam cinema."@en .
