<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suchitra_Murali> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Suchitra Murali, commonly known by her stage name Suchitra, is an Indian actress. Debuting in a lead role with the 1990 film No.20 Madras Mail at the age of 14, she has appeared mostly in Malayalam films as well as a few films in Tamil."@en .
