<http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Rise_of_the_Phoenix> <http://dbpedia.org/property/quote> "\"This album reflects where I am now in my life. I am perfecting myself. I’m learning to burn away the old mindset, the negativity that weighed me down so I can become the best me. I see myself becoming clearer and stronger and I’m back with a new vengeance. I am the Phoenix rising and I’m living my life again!\""@en .
