<http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Rise_of_the_Phoenix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Rise of the Phoenix is the seventh studio album by American R&B artist Chanté Moore released on September 29, 2017, through CM7 Records. The album has been preceded by the release of two singles — \"Real One\" and \"Something to Remember\". The album was released exactly 25 years from the date of her debut album Precious (1992)."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Rise_of_the_Phoenix> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "The Rise of the Phoenix is the seventh studio album by American R&B artist Chanté Moore released on September 29, 2017, through CM7 Records. The album has been preceded by the release of two singles — \"Real One\" and \"Something to Remember\". The album was released exactly 25 years from the date of her debut album Precious (1992)."@en .
