<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Southwest_Conference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Southwest Conference (SWC) was an NCAA Division I college athletic conference in the United States that existed from 1914 to 1996. Composed primarily of schools from Texas, at various times the conference included schools from Oklahoma and Arkansas."@en .
