<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Suddenly_Human> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\"Suddenly Human\" is the 78th episode of the American science fiction television series Star Trek: The Next Generation, the fourth episode of the fourth season. Set in the 24th century, the series follows the adventures of the Starfleet crew of the Federation starship Enterprise-D. In this episode, the Enterprise rescues a Starfleet admiral's grandson, long thought dead, but who had been adopted and raised by the enemies who killed the boy's parents."@en .
