<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Up/Down> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\"Up/Down\" is a song by Australian recording artist Jessica Mauboy, taken from her debut studio album Been Waiting (2008). Written by Kwamé Holland and Frankie Storm, \"Up/Down\" was released as the fifth single from Been Waiting on 28 August 2009. It peaked at number 11 on the ARIA Singles Chart and was certified gold by the Australian Recording Industry Association (ARIA)."@en .
