<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vijay_Menon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vijay Menon is an Indian actor, editor, director and dubbing artist in Malayalam cinema. He has acted in more than 100 films in South Indian languages. He mainly handles in character roles and supporting roles. He has won Kerala State Film Awards thrice, including Kerala State Film Award for Best Dubbing Artist twice in 2011 a Kerala State Film Award – Special Mention for Hey Jude in 2017."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vijay_Menon> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/abstract> "Vijay Menon is an Indian actor, editor, director and dubbing artist in Malayalam cinema. He has acted in more than 100 films in South Indian languages. He mainly handles in character roles and supporting roles. He has won Kerala State Film Awards thrice, including Kerala State Film Award for Best Dubbing Artist twice in 2011 a Kerala State Film Award – Special Mention for Hey Jude in 2017."@en .
