<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Women's_Royal_Canadian_Naval_Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Women's Royal Canadian Naval Service (WRCNS or \"Wrens\") was an element of the Royal Canadian Navy that was active during the Second World War and post-war as part of the Royal Canadian Naval Reserve until unification in 1968. The WRCNS was in operation from October 1942 to August 1946."@en .
